The Sphere of Fire activated in Gallubia Valley has already let the temperature rise a little. We have to activate this other Sphere of Fire at the bottom of the sea. Zarad said the water people, although used to low temperatures, are fleeing to other areas. But soon they will have nowhere to go.
The Snow Tribe is joining the Snowstorm Dragon at the place that was once its tomb and is now its lair.

Go to the Frozen Abyss of the Sea and activate the Sphere of Fire.

[Challenge Objective]

Defeat 100 monsters in the Frozen Abyss of the Sea and summon the Sphere of Fire in the marked area.
When you are done, talk to Ruby, the Fire Priestess, in Pillai.
